---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy — World Cup Draft Simulator"
  description="Privacy policy for World Cup Draft Simulator. Explains what data is collected when you use the fantasy football draft simulator website."
/>

<main class="min-h-screen bg-canvas text-white">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 sm:py-24">
    <p class="font-mono text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[1.8px] text-mint uppercase">
      Legal
    </p>
    <h1 class="mt-4 font-display text-5xl leading-[0.9] tracking-[1.07px] sm:text-6xl">
      Privacy Policy
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-secondary">Last updated: 2026</p>

    <div class="mt-10 space-y-8 text-sm leading-relaxed text-secondary">
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl tracking-[0.5px] text-white">1. Overview</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          World Cup Draft Simulator ("we", "us") respects your privacy. This
          policy explains what information is collected when you visit and use
          this website, and how it is used. By using the site you agree to the
          practices described here.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl tracking-[0.5px] text-white">2. Information we collect</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          This is a browser-based game. We do not require an account and we do
          not collect personal information such as your name or email address
          to play. The game state (your draft, your squad, your tournament
          results) is stored only in your own browser and is not sent to our
          servers.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3">
          We may collect standard, non-identifying technical data such as your
          IP address, browser type, device type, and pages visited, to
          understand usage and improve the site.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl tracking-[0.5px] text-white">3. Cookies and analytics</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          We may use cookies and similar technologies to remember preferences
          and to collect analytics about site usage. Third-party analytics
          providers may use cookies to measure traffic and trends. You can
          disable cookies in your browser settings, though some site features
          may not work as well without them.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl tracking-[0.5px] text-white">4. How we use information</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Information we collect is used to operate, maintain and improve the
          site, to understand how visitors use the game, and to fix bugs and
          performance issues. We do not sell your personal information.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl tracking-[0.5px] text-white">5. Data sharing</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          We do not share personal information with third parties except:
          (a) with service providers who help operate the site and are bound to
          keep it confidential; (b) where required by law or to protect rights
          and safety.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl tracking-[0.5px] text-white">6. Children's privacy</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          The site is not directed to children under 13, and we do not
          knowingly collect personal information from children under 13.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl tracking-[0.5px] text-white">7. Your choices</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          You can clear your game data by clearing your browser storage, and
          opt out of cookie-based tracking through your browser settings or the
          analytics provider's opt-out tools.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl tracking-[0.5px] text-white">8. Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          We may update this policy from time to time. Changes will be posted
          on this page with an updated "Last updated" date.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl tracking-[0.5px] text-white">9. Contact</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Questions about this policy? <a class="text-mint underline" href="/contact">Contact us</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>